==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}}, confer the term {{term|durri}}.

===Adjective===
{{is-adj-01|þurr|þurrt|þurrari|þurrastur}}

# [[dry]]; without [[liquid]]
# [[dry]], [[alcohol-free]]; without [[alcohol]]
#: ''Þetta var '''þurr''' helgi.''
#:: It was an '''alcohol-free''' weekend.
#: ''Sádí-Arabía er '''þurt''' land.''
#:: Saudi Arabia is an '''alcohol-free''' country.

====Derived terms====
* [[þurr á manninn]] (brusque)
* [[upp úr þurru]] (suddenly, out of nothing, unprovoked)

